items.prompt:
Match the sentence starters in Column I with the endings in Column II to form grammatically and contextually correct sentences.

**Column I**
(A) You must have been tired after the trek;
(B) You should not shout at the waiter yesterday;
(C) You need not have cooked so much food;

**Column II**
(D) you slept for twelve hours straight.
(E) only four guests turned up.
(F) he was only doing his job.
